  "details": "build 751 2019.2.1p5\n\nWe have already emailed support.\nAn error log has been submitted.\nI will report here as well.\n\nI can not put myself only in my new world.\nOther players will enter.\nIn addition to me, I found a producer with the same problem on Twitter! The symptoms are completely the same.\nThis problem has been ongoing for about a week.\nIt is a very sad bug that can not share the created world with other players. Early measures are required.\n\nSymptoms\n・ We join the world and can hear BGM. After that, you will be returned to the loading screen without looking at the world. Repeat this.\n・ The same is true for any kind of instance.\n-You can sometimes join, but if you open SOCIAL or open steam overlay, it will be blocked after heavy loading.\n\nMeasures taken\n・ Delete cache file\n・ Delete registry\n・ Create another account\n・ 3 PCs (Low Mid High Spec)\n・ Restarting router\n・ Change of world ID\n・ Change of avatar at the time of Join\n・ Optimize the world as much as possible\n・ Invalid of security\n\nGuess\n・ Is it recognized to DDoS, IP or PC information is registered in the black list?\n\nOn Twitter, I found a user with the same problem!\nI am not alone!",
